{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261029/photo/bkn-20261029114142485-1029_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261029114531\"/><p>北韓屢進行武器試射。</p><p>南韓聯合參謀本部周四（29日）指，北韓當天向朝鮮半島東部海域發射了不明飛行物。日本防衞省表示，北韓發射的可能是彈道導彈。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T04:00:54.505899+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":79,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T03:41:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T03:58:27.986039+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T03:58:27.986039+00:00","content_hash":"af7687fea008c990192bf1fbf67cb92d4b8fbeba7fc57d20dc2a201cd8152c9a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}